      ":question/problem": "Find $(A+B)-C-(B-C)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 3 \\\\ 7 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 9\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 8 \\\\ 6 & 6\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>",
